<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1.0,maximum-scale=1.0,user-scalable=no">
<title>NT-06 山茶花奶茶 · 沧林食品</title>
<style>
*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}
body{font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"PingFang SC","Microsoft YaHei",sans-serif;background:#f0e9e2;color:#2c2c2c;padding:24px 16px;line-height:1.7}
.card{max-width:540px;margin:0 auto;background:#faf8f5;border-radius:18px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 2px 20px rgba(0,0,0,.05)}
.meta{padding:20px 22px 14px;background:#fdf8f0;border-bottom:1px solid #eee5d8}
.meta .badge{display:inline-block;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#C0392B;background:#fef2ee;padding:2px 10px;border-radius:4px;margin-bottom:6px}
.meta h1{font-size:20px;font-weight:700;color:#3a322a;line-height:1.3;margin-bottom:2px}
.meta .sub{font-size:12px;color:#b5aaa0;margin-bottom:10px}
.meta .tags{display:flex;gap:4px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.meta .tags span{font-size:10px;padding:2px 10px;background:#f5ede5;border-radius:12px;color:#5a4f44}
.level-banner{display:flex;gap:8px;padding:10px 22px;background:#fef9f2;border-bottom:1px solid #eee5d8;flex-wrap:wrap}
.level-item{font-size:11px;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:#f0e9e2;color:#5a4f44}
.level-item.high{background:#C0392B;color:#fff}
.level-item.med{background:#E8D5B0;color:#5a4f44}
.section{padding:14px 22px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee5d8}
.s-title{font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:#3a322a;margin-bottom:10px;padding-bottom:4px;border-bottom:2px solid #f0ece6}
.story{font-size:13px;line-height:2;color:#5a4f44}
.story em{color:#C0392B;font-style:normal;font-weight:600}
.index-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:6px}
.index-item{background:#f8f4ef;border-radius:8px;padding:8px 10px;text-align:center}
.index-item .label{font-size:9px;color:#b5aaa0}
.index-item .num{font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#C0392B}
.index-item .desc{font-size:9px;color:#7a7269;margin-top:2px}
.cost-box{padding:12px 14px;background:#f8f4ef;border-radius:10px;margin-bottom:8px}
.row{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:13px;padding:4px 0;color:#3a322a}
.row .v{font-weight:600}
.row.tot{border-top:1px solid #ddd4ca;margin-top:4px;padding-top:8px;font-weight:700;color:#C0392B}
.roi{display:flex;gap:6px;margin-top:8px}
.roi-b{flex:1;padding:8px;border-radius:8px;text-align:center;font-size:11px}
.roi-b .d{font-size:15px;font-weight:700;margin:2px 0}
.roi-b.c{background:#fdf2ee;color:#E8652D}
.roi-b.n{background:#fef6ec;color:#D4A574}
.roi-b.i{background:#f0f6ec;color:#5a8f3c}
.risk-item{display:flex;gap:8px;padding:5px 0;font-size:12px;color:#5a4f44}
.risk-stars{display:flex;gap:2px;margin-left:auto;flex-shrink:0;font-size:10px}
.risk-stars .on{color:#D4A574}
.risk-stars .off{color:#ddd}
.launch{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;margin-top:6px}
.launch span{padding:5px 10px;background:#f8f4ef;border-radius:6px;font-size:11px;color:#5a4f44}
.scene-grid{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px}
.scene-item{padding:5px 12px;background:#f0f6ec;color:#4a7a3c;border-radius:6px;font-size:11px;font-weight:600}
.dpair{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:6px}
.dpair-item{flex:1;min-width:140px;padding:8px 10px;background:#f8f4ef;border-radius:8px;text-align:center}
.dpair-item .name{font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:#3a322a}
.dpair-item .price{font-size:10px;color:#b5aaa0;margin-top:2px}
.comp{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px}
.comp-item{display:flex;gap:8px;font-size:12px;color:#5a4f44;padding:5px 8px;background:#f8f4ef;border-radius:6px}
.comp-item .tag{font-size:9px;padding:1px 6px;border-radius:3px;margin-left:auto;flex-shrink:0}
.comp-item .tag.adv{background:#f0f6ec;color:#5a8f3c}
.copy-box{padding:10px 14px;background:#f8f4ef;border-radius:8px;font-size:12px;color:#5a4f44;line-height:1.8;margin-top:6px}
.copy-box em{color:#C0392B;font-style:normal}
.tip-item{display:flex;gap:8px;padding:5px 0;font-size:12px;color:#5a4f44}
.pay{padding:20px 22px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fdf8f0,#f5ede5)}
.pay .lock-icon{font-size:28px;text-align:center;margin-bottom:4px}
.pay h3{font-size:15px;font-weight:700;text-align:center;color:#3a322a;margin-bottom:8px}
.pay ul{list-style:none;padding:0;margin-bottom:10px}
.pay ul li{font-size:12px;color:#5a4f44;padding:4px 0 4px 16px;position:relative;line-height:1.6}
.pay ul li::before{content:"✓";position:absolute;left:0;color:#5a8f3c;font-weight:700}
.pay .price-tag{font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#C0392B;text-align:center;margin:10px 0 8px}
.pay .price-tag small{font-size:12px;font-weight:400;color:#b5aaa0}
.pay .btn{display:block;text-align:center;padding:11px;background:#C0392B;color:#fff;border-radius:8px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;margin-top:12px}
.pay .note{font-size:10px;color:#b5aaa0;text-align:center;margin-top:6px}
.ftr{text-align:center;padding:16px 22px;font-size:10px;color:#bbb}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="card">

<div class="meta">
  <div class="badge">NT-06 · ¥39</div>
  <h1>山茶花奶茶</h1>
  <div class="sub">奶茶 · 摆摊 ✅ 夜市 ✅ 流动 ✅ 开店 ✅</div>
  <div class="tags">
    <span>#花香奶茶</span>
    <span>#高级感</span>
    <span>#高颜值</span>
    <span>#女性市场</span>
    <span>#差异化</span>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="level-banner">
  <span class="level-item high">推荐⭐⭐⭐⭐</span>
  <span class="level-item med">高颜值</span>
  <span class="level-item med">女性最爱</span>
  <span class="level-item med">利润不错</span>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title">发现这款产品</div>
  <div class="story">
    山茶花奶茶是近两年茶饮界的新贵。山茶花的花香非常特别——不像玫瑰那么浓烈，不像茉莉那么清冽，而是一种淡雅的、带着蜜甜感的花香，和奶搭配起来有一种"高级感"。<br><br>
    最早是在杭州一家精品茶饮店喝到的，老板说山茶花茶底是福建那边的工艺茶，用山茶花鲜花窨制乌龙茶或者绿茶底。山茶花的花香非常干净，没有杂味，跟爱护奶咖和牛奶融合之后，花香被奶脂包裹住，入口是奶香，回味是花香。<br><br>
    成本6.5元卖17元，毛利62%。这款特别适合女性消费群体，很多女生对花香类奶茶完全没有抵抗力，而且山茶花这个名字本身就自带高级感和想象空间。
  </div>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title">项目指数</div>
  <div class="index-grid">
    <div class="index-item"><div class="label">轻资产</div><div class="num">★★★★★</div><div class="desc">投入约1200元</div></div>
    <div class="index-item"><div class="label">难度</div><div class="num">★★☆☆☆</div><div class="desc">简单好上手</div></div>
    <div class="index-item"><div class="label">利润</div><div class="num">★★★★☆</div><div class="desc">62%毛利率</div></div>
    <div class="index-item"><div class="label">复购</div><div class="num">★★★★☆</div><div class="desc">花香控持续回购</div></div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title">成本利润</div>
  <div class="cost-box">
    <div class="row"><span>卖价</span><span class="v">17元/杯（500ml）</span></div>
    <div class="row"><span>成本</span><span class="v">6.5元/杯</span></div>
    <div class="row"><span>单杯利润</span><span class="v" style="color:#C0392B">10.5元</span></div>
    <div class="row"><span>日销30杯日利润</span><span class="v">315元</span></div>
    <div class="row"><span>日销50杯日利润</span><span class="v">525元</span></div>
    <div class="row tot"><span>设备投入</span><span class="v">约1200元</span></div>
  </div>
  <div style="font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:#3a322a;margin-top:6px">回本周期</div>
  <div class="roi">
    <div class="roi-b c"><div>保守</div><div class="d">7天</div><div>日销30杯</div></div>
    <div class="roi-b n"><div>正常</div><div class="d">5天</div><div>日销50杯</div></div>
    <div class="roi-b i"><div>理想</div><div class="d">3天</div><div>日销80杯</div></div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title">项目风险</div>
  <div class="risk-item">
    <span>认知门槛</span>
    <span class="risk-stars"><span class="on">★</span><span class="on">★</span><span class="on">★</span><span class="off">☆</span><span class="off">☆</span></span>
    <span style="font-size:10px;color:#b5aaa0;margin-left:auto">山茶花味需要描述</span>
  </div>
  <div class="risk-item">
    <span>茶叶供应</span>
    <span class="risk-stars"><span class="on">★</span><span class="on">★</span><span class="on">★</span><span class="off">☆</span><span class="off">☆</span></span>
    <span style="font-size:10px;color:#b5aaa0;margin-left:auto">山茶花茶渠道有限</span>
  </div>
  <div class="risk-item">
    <span>定位小众</span>
    <span class="risk-stars"><span class="on">★</span><span class="on">★</span><span class="on">★</span><span class="off">☆</span><span class="off">☆</span></span>
    <span style="font-size:10px;color:#b5aaa0;margin-left:auto">但受众粘性高</span>
  </div>
  <div class="risk-item">
    <span>季节影响</span>
    <span class="risk-stars"><span class="on">★</span><span class="on">★</span><span class="off">☆</span><span class="off">☆</span><span class="off">☆</span></span>
    <span style="font-size:10px;color:#b5aaa0;margin-left:auto">冷热皆可，全年能卖</span>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title">启动清单</div>
  <div class="launch">
    <span>保温桶 200元</span>
    <span>雪克杯 30元</span>
    <span>量杯 15元</span>
    <span>封口机 350元</span>
    <span>杯子+盖 0.3元/套</span>
    <span>展示冰柜 800元</span>
    <span>热水壶 80元</span>
  </div>
  <div style="display:flex;gap:12px;margin-top:8px;font-size:11px;color:#5a4f44">
    <span><strong>总投入：</strong>约1200元</span>
    <span><strong>占地：</strong>1.2m长桌</span>
    <span><strong>人员：</strong>1人</span>
    <span><strong>上手：</strong>1天</span>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title">适合场景</div>
  <div class="scene-grid">
    <span class="scene-item">✅ 学校门口</span>
    <span class="scene-item">✅ 商业街</span>
    <span class="scene-item">✅ 步行街</span>
    <span class="scene-item">✅ 花市周边</span>
    <span class="scene-item">✅ 创意市集</span>
    <span class="scene-item">✅ 网红店</span>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title">推荐搭配</div>
  <div class="story" style="font-size:12px;color:#5a4f44;margin-bottom:8px">单品卖17元 → 客单价17元</div>
  <div class="dpair">
    <div class="dpair-item">
      <div class="name">山茶花奶茶 + 花型饼干</div>
      <div class="price">套餐价22元 · 客单价↑29%</div>
    </div>
    <div class="dpair-item">
      <div class="name">山茶花奶茶 + 鲜花饼</div>
      <div class="price">套餐价23元 · 客单价↑35%</div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="dpair" style="margin-top:6px">
    <div class="dpair-item">
      <div class="name">山茶花奶茶 + 蛋糕卷</div>
      <div class="price">套餐价24元 · 客单价↑41%</div>
    </div>
    <div class="dpair-item">
      <div class="name">山茶花奶茶 + 马卡龙</div>
      <div class="price">套餐价25元 · 客单价↑47%</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title">对标项目 & 竞争优势</div>
  <div class="comp">
    <div class="comp-item"><span>对标：普通花香奶茶（15-20元）</span><span class="tag adv">山茶花香更高级</span></div>
    <div class="comp-item"><span>对标：大牌同款（25-32元）</span><span class="tag adv">价格便宜40%</span></div>
    <div class="comp-item"><span>对标：花茶冲剂（1-3元）</span><span class="tag adv">现泡+真奶口感</span></div>
  </div>
  <div style="margin-top:6px;font-size:11px;color:#5a4f44;line-height:1.8">
    ✔ 山茶花花香天然高级，产品定位可以卖贵<br>
    ✔ 市面上山茶花奶茶不多，差异化明显<br>
    ✔ 颜值高，适合女生拍照分享<br>
    ✔ 操作标准化，出品快
  </div>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title">销售话术</div>
  <div class="copy-box">
    "山茶花窨制的茶底，花香是天然的"<br>
    "入口是奶香，回味是山茶花，很高级"<br>
    "这杯发朋友圈会被问爆的"<br>
    路过喊一嗓子：<em>"山茶花奶茶，喝一口就像在花园里"</em>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title">避坑指南</div>
  <div class="tip-item">⚠️ <span><strong>山茶花茶要买正经窨制的</strong>——有些便宜的"山茶花茶"是茉莉花茶加点香精，完全不是那个味道。正经山茶花茶是福建工艺茶，一斤80-120元，能泡100杯</span></div>
  <div class="tip-item">⚠️ <span><strong>水温别太高</strong>——山茶花茶属于花茶类，水温85-90度最佳，太高了花香会被破坏，泡出来有闷味</span></div>
  <div class="tip-item">⚠️ <span><strong>奶量要控制</strong>——山茶花香比较淡雅，奶加多了花香就被完全盖住了。爱护奶咖+全脂牛奶的总量控制在茶汤的1/3左右</span></div>
  <div class="tip-item">⚠️ <span><strong>甜度别太高</strong>——淡雅的花香配微甜才高级，建议默认低糖，提供"无糖/低糖/正常"三档选择</span></div>
  <div class="tip-item">⚠️ <span><strong>杯子要用透明的</strong>——山茶花奶茶的颜色是淡淡的米白色，用透明杯+花形贴纸，颜值翻倍，不然白瞎了这杯颜值</span></div>
</div>

<div class="pay">
  <div class="lock-icon">🔒</div>
  <h3>¥39 解锁完整版</h3>
  <ul>
    <li>完整配方：山茶花茶底/爱护奶咖/全脂牛奶精确配比</li>
    <li>完整工艺：泡茶温度·时间·茶奶比·冰量换算</li>
    <li>成本拆分：原料/包装/损耗/摊位费逐项算清</li>
    <li>供应链信息：山茶花茶叶品牌/爱护奶咖批发渠道</li>
    <li>4种变体：山茶花拿铁/山茶花冰茶/山茶花奶盖/山茶花冻</li>
    <li>摆摊视觉方案：杯子/灯牌/菜单拍照指南</li>
  </ul>
  <div class="price-tag">¥39 <small>永久解锁</small></div>
  <a class="btn" href="javascript:void(0)">📱 加微信 · 39元解锁配方</a>
  <div class="note">加好友备注"NT-06"优先通过</div>
</div>

<div class="ftr">
  <div>沧林 · 食品工业知识库</div>
  <div>微信 canglin1985 · foodintelai.com</div>
</div>

</div>
</body>
